            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crawling Angels</strong> is a physics-based horror puzzle game with sandbox elements. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a variety of tools to interact with the Forever Chicken, a living ragdoll at the heart of a mysterious midnight carnival. Under the watchful eye of Uncle Tontine, speak in whispers with other children taken from their homes and uncover the writhing truth behind the carnival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958640/extras/344b273f981363448bebc6f94fb33814.poster.avif?t=1792800001\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958640/extras/344b273f981363448bebc6f94fb33814.webm?t=1792800001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958640/extras/344b273f981363448bebc6f94fb33814.mp4?t=1792800001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teach dead rats to smoke cigarettes. Play with loaded firearms. Throw dance parties for cockroaches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The carnival's demands are many and absurd. Solve riddles, charades, and bizarre physical challenges built around the Forever Chicken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958640/extras/4a14155a17a9b2fe650337e1b2844c43.poster.avif?t=1792800001\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958640/extras/4a14155a17a9b2fe650337e1b2844c43.webm?t=1792800001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958640/extras/4a14155a17a9b2fe650337e1b2844c43.mp4?t=1792800001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes it wants to be shot. Sometimes it wants to explode. Sometimes it merely wants to watch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whatever the chicken seeks, you must determine before the night is through.</p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crawling Angels</strong> is a physics-based horror puzzle game with sandbox elements. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a variety of tools to interact with the Forever Chicken, a living ragdoll at the heart of a mysterious midnight carnival. Under the watchful eye of Uncle Tontine, speak in whispers with other children taken from their homes and uncover the writhing truth behind the carnival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958640/extras/344b273f981363448bebc6f94fb33814.poster.avif?t=1792800001\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958640/extras/344b273f981363448bebc6f94fb33814.webm?t=1792800001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958640/extras/344b273f981363448bebc6f94fb33814.mp4?t=1792800001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teach dead rats to smoke cigarettes. Play with loaded firearms. Throw dance parties for cockroaches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The carnival's demands are many and absurd. Solve riddles, charades, and bizarre physical challenges built around the Forever Chicken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958640/extras/4a14155a17a9b2fe650337e1b2844c43.poster.avif?t=1792800001\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958640/extras/4a14155a17a9b2fe650337e1b2844c43.webm?t=1792800001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958640/extras/4a14155a17a9b2fe650337e1b2844c43.mp4?t=1792800001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes it wants to be shot. Sometimes it wants to explode. Sometimes it merely wants to watch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whatever the chicken seeks, you must determine before the night is through.</p>",
