                "notes": "Violence toward animate and inanimate plush dolls.\r\nDepiction of painless self-mutilation by a minor.\r\nDepictions of angelic parasitism, including that of a minor.\r\nDeath of minors via rapid mutation.\r\nDeath of a minor via magical lightning.\r\nDepictions of human corpses, including the corpses of minors, at various stages of decay.\r\nInteractive animal carrion and human corpses.\r\nDepiction and use of firearms by a minor.\r\nImplied cannibalism.\r\nA fully destructible, interactive heretical offshoot of the Holy Bible.\r\nMention of a real-life hate group.\r\nDepictions of real-life occult symbols.\r\nViolence toward a deformed humanoid creature.\r\nDepictions of cigarettes and empty alcohol containers.\r\nViolence toward insects.\r\nDiscussion of inappropriate contact between minors.\r\nA single curse word."
